278
00:21:23,374 --> 00:21:29,780
Reading commands are safe; gh pr create
and gh pr merge are caution; --admin and

279
00:21:29,820 --> 00:21:33,003
every non-GET gh api call are dangerous.

280
00:21:33,343 --> 00:21:39,095
gh api defaults to GET, switches to POST
when a field is passed, and returns 30

281
00:21:39,135 --> 00:21:41,587
items per page without --paginate.

282
00:21:41,927 --> 00:21:48,316
The REST API is versioned by a date
header; without it you get 2022-11-28.

283
00:21:48,656 --> 00:21:52,647
An integration that must outlive you
should be a GitHub App, with installation

